      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those critiques are often rooted in a fundamental misunderstanding of what modern, equitable workplaces require. The concept of a pure, unadulterated meritocracy is a myth that benefits only those already in power. Effective DEI programs don't undermine merit; they expand the definition of merit to include diverse perspectives, which is what drives superior business outcomes.",
      "source": "target",
